{"id":"1dbad5ff3e49f5f6","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-filter-coideal.md","title":"ZFC Filter Coideal","display":"df-zfc-filter-coideal — ZFC Filter Coideal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-filter-coideal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-filter-coideal"],"display":"df-zfc-filter-coideal — ZFC Filter Coideal","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-filter-coideal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-filter-coideal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-filter-coideal — ZFC Filter Coideal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (set), <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> (proper ideal on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>), and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\">\\(\\mathcal H\\)</span> (coideal candidate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (ideal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e4f95381faac4f9\" href=\"?note=6e4f95381faac4f9\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md\">../batch05/58-df-ideal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCoideal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCoideal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}coideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterCoideal}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\mathcal H=\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}coideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterCoideal}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\mathcal H=\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Properness is expressed using the canonical ideal predicate: the greatest element <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(X)\">\\(\\mathcal P(X)\\)</span> is not in the ideal.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-ideal.md","status":"resolved","id":"6e4f95381faac4f9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2$ (ideal predicate from [[../batch05/58-df-ideal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ideal}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCoideal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}filter\\text{-}coideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFilterCoideal}_S(\\mathcal H,\\mathcal I,X)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ideal}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal P(X))\\land X\\notin\\mathcal I\\land\\mathcal H=\\mathcal P(X)\\setminus\\mathcal I","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(X)","display":false}],"bytes":933,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1875","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-filter-coideal.md|58-df-zfc-filter-coideal]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["6e4f95381faac4f9"]}